<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- ADVANCED LIGHTING STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- ADVANCED LIGHTING STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley analyst Jennifer Pokrzywinski started coverage of Advanced Lighting Technologies Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/2 to 24-3/4.</p>
